  "briefing": "## Situation\nDaylight, clear. Post Alpha is on the edge of a busy market town. Several civilian hobby drones are flying over the town today. One hostile quadcopter is expected.\n## Mission\nDetect, identify and defeat the hostile before it reaches Post Alpha. Do not harm civilians: no intercepts over the town, and check the jam sector before jamming. Contact reports are expected: send one for every threat track (R).\n## ROE\nWEAPONS TIGHT — intercept only tracks you have classified as a threat type and declared HOSTILE. No intercepts inside the marked no-kinetic zones (settlements).\n## Assets\n- Radar, EO/IR camera and RF detector on high ground near the asset\n- RF jammer, 2.0 km, ±10° sector, 10 s cycle\n- GNSS spoofer, 2.0 km, ±10° sector, 15 s cycle\n- Interceptor, 1.5 km, 2 rounds, 6 s reload\n## Intel\nThe hostile is RF-controlled and expected from the north, over the town. Civilian drones are RF-linked too: jamming the hostile's bearing also jams any civilian in the same sector.",
